{
    "title": "Block Crush: Block Puzzle Game",
    "description": "Block Crush is a combination of traditional Block Puzzle game with an innovative gameplay in a 10x10 board, which has a larger space than the classic block game. There are more blocks move possibilities with blocks on a 10x10 board.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd2 Features of Block Crush: \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfac Are you looking for new props in a classic block game? We offer rotation props that enables you to rotate the blocks that will help you to solve  you can eliminate more blocks.\r\n\u23f0 Block Crush provides an extra space for you to store one block.  You can temporarily store the blocks that can't be placed on the board and reuse it at any time afterwards.\r\n\ud83c\udf37 Are you bored of playing block games alone?  There are more moves possibilities on a 10x10 grids. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd2 How to play Block Crush - Cube Puzzle Game:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Drag the blocks and place them on the board. When blocks fill up a row or column, the blocks will be eliminated and you will then score accordingly. Squares can also be eliminated in multiple rows or columns, resulting in more points.\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Rotation Props:  Click on the rotation props - You will be able to change the direction of the blocks to better fit in the grids.\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Extra Space (Holder): The holder allows you to temporarily store a block and you can choose to retrieve and put on the grid whenever it fits.\r\n\ud83c\udf67 Resurrection: If two or more blocks cannot be placed, the game fails. At this time, you will have an extra chance to restart the game on the board layout before the failure.\r\n\r\nCome and enjoy this interesting and unique gameplay design!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Block Crush is a combination of traditional Block Puzzle game with an innovative gameplay in a 10x10 board, which has a larger space than the classic block game. There are more blocks move possibilities with blocks on a 10x10 board.<br><br>\ud83d\udcd2 Features of Block Crush: <br><br>\ud83c\udfac Are you looking for new props in a classic block game? We offer rotation props that enables you to rotate the blocks that will help you to solve  you can eliminate more blocks.<br>\u23f0 Block Crush provides an extra space for you to store one block.  You can temporarily store the blocks that can&#39;t be placed on the board and reuse it at any time afterwards.<br>\ud83c\udf37 Are you bored of playing block games alone?  There are more moves possibilities on a 10x10 grids. <br><br>\ud83d\udcd2 How to play Block Crush - Cube Puzzle Game:<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Drag the blocks and place them on the board. When blocks fill up a row or column, the blocks will be eliminated and you will then score accordingly. Squares can also be eliminated in multiple rows or columns, resulting in more points.<br>\ud83d\udd04 Rotation Props:  Click on the rotation props - You will be able to change the direction of the blocks to better fit in the grids.<br>\ud83d\udd0d Extra Space (Holder): The holder allows you to temporarily store a block and you can choose to retrieve and put on the grid whenever it fits.<br>\ud83c\udf67 Resurrection: If two or more blocks cannot be placed, the game fails. At this time, you will have an extra chance to restart the game on the board layout before the failure.<br><br>Come and enjoy this interesting and unique gameplay design!",
